    <string name="auto_books_hint">Kyobo Library · Millie · Aladin · Bookers</string>
    <string name="auto_books_desc">When you open a book on the Kyobo Library, Millie, Aladin or Bookers shelf, it goes to the top of your reading list. Only book titles, authors, progress, due dates and covers on the shelf and search screens are read; other apps are never seen. Turn on Pebble Desk in Accessibility.</string>
